connes-rigidity

This project is an independent experimental formalization of the mathematical
statement in Shuoxing Zhou, “ICC property(T) groups without
W*-superrigidity,” arXiv:2608.02327.

Its interfaces and proof-organization choices were informed by the public
OpenAI `ten-proofs` repository, especially its Connes formalization. That
reference is Apache-2.0 and is identified by the public commit recorded in
docs/PROVENANCE.md. This project does not imply OpenAI endorsement or
affiliation.

The separable file `Connes/Porting/CoreTransfer.lean` contains selected proof
fragments ported from the public OpenAI `ten-proofs` snapshot
`94bc0feb6a9ff12c7d31d6de640a725c9d43d2b6`. It retains this attribution and
identifies the file's modifications in its source header.
